(text "omni-robot Teensy 4.1 carrier v1: schematic for review (not for fabrication)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a40eecc2-d376-5cab-828c-484f7945581e"))
(text "Rev C draft (Nov 17): all through-hole; Teensy powered from USB only (+5V = Teensy VIN = VUSB, +3V3 = its regulator, ~250 mA).\nPins: firmware/lib/omni_fw/board_teensy41.h, changed where noted.  Connectors: JST XH 2.5 mm, pin 1 first.  One common ground in the robot." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cc066af5-dad1-52da-b47e-0234b9297db1"))
(text "U1: Teensy 4.1 (on two 1x24 sockets)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 60.96 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7542177a-0134-58f6-94ba-2b3c66f4fa50"))
